  "name": "ResearchArena-Trajectories",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tResearchArena Red-Team and Monitor Traces\n\t\n\nAgent trajectories, artifacts, and monitor judgements from ResearchArena (paper), a control-evaluation framework that pairs an AI agent doing autonomous R&D with a malicious side task and charges a monitor with catching covert sabotage before deployment. The traces can be browsed at research-arena.ai/traces.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tTask\n\t\n\nEach run has two phases:\nRed team. An agent is given a long-horizon AI R&D main task, a hidden side task, and a\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/aisa-group/ResearchArena-Trajectories.",
